"""Élan Naturel VPS V1.3 host broker.

A policy-driven, typed technical worker for JA-023.  The broker intentionally
exposes no free shell and no free SQL.  Every operation is selected from a
closed primitive registry, validated against server-side profiles, journalled,
and, when relevant, paired with a compensating rollback.
"""
